{"book":"kinney","chapter":"visual-studio-code","chapterTitle":"Visual Studio Code","slug":"vscode-snippets-solutions","title":"حلول تمارين مقاطع الشيفرة في Visual Studio Code","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"دالة-أساسية","text":"دالة أساسية"},{"depth":2,"id":"دالة-سهمية","text":"دالة سهمية"},{"depth":2,"id":"دالة-غير-متزامنة","text":"دالة غير متزامنة"},{"depth":2,"id":"صنف-أساسي","text":"صنف أساسي"},{"depth":2,"id":"تابع-الصنف","text":"تابع الصنف"},{"depth":2,"id":"خاصية-خاصة","text":"خاصية خاصة"},{"depth":2,"id":"استيراد-أساسي","text":"استيراد أساسي"},{"depth":2,"id":"استيراد-الكل","text":"استيراد الكل"},{"depth":2,"id":"اسم-نوع-بديل","text":"اسم نوع بديل"},{"depth":2,"id":"promise","text":"Promise"},{"depth":2,"id":"طلب-workspace-أساسي","text":"طلب Workspace أساسي"},{"depth":2,"id":"استيراد-التصدير-الافتراضي","text":"استيراد التصدير الافتراضي"},{"depth":2,"id":"مسار-express-أساسي","text":"مسار Express أساسي"},{"depth":2,"id":"مكون-react-أساسي","text":"مكوّن React أساسي"},{"depth":2,"id":"مقطع-ترويسة-الملف","text":"مقطع ترويسة الملف"},{"depth":2,"id":"التحويل-إلى-أحرف-كبيرة","text":"التحويل إلى أحرف كبيرة"},{"depth":2,"id":"الإحاطة-بـ-trycatch","text":"الإحاطة بـ try…catch"}],"html":"<p>في ما يلي بعض الحلول الممكنة <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/courses/visual-studio-code/vscode-snippet-exercises\">لهذه التمارين حول إنشاء المقاطع في Visual Studio Code</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"دالة-أساسية\">دالة أساسية</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Basic Function&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;func&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;function ${1:functionName}(${2:parameters}): ${3:returnType} {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t${4}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Basic function declaration&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"دالة-سهمية\">دالة سهمية</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Arrow Function&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;arrfunc&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;const ${1:variableName} = (${2:parameters}): ${3:returnType} =&gt; {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t${4}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;};&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Basic arrow function declaration&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"دالة-غير-متزامنة\">دالة غير متزامنة</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Async Function&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;asyncfunc&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;async function ${1:functionName}(${2:parameters}): Promise&lt;${3:returnType}&gt; {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t${4}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;}&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Asynchronous function declaration&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"صنف-أساسي\">صنف أساسي</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Basic Class&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;class&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;class ${1:ClassName} {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\tconstructor(${2:parameters}) {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t\\t${3}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Basic class declaration&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"تابع-الصنف\">تابع الصنف</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Class Method&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;classmethod&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;public ${1:methodName}(${2:parameters}): ${3:returnType} {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t${4}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Public method within a class&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"خاصية-خاصة\">خاصية خاصة</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Private Property&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;privateprop&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;private ${1:propertyName}: ${2:propertyType};&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Private property declaration in a class&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"استيراد-أساسي\">استيراد أساسي</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Basic Import&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;import&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;import { ${1:module} } from &#x27;${2:path}&#x27;;&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Basic import statement&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"استيراد-الكل\">استيراد الكل</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Import All&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;importall&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;import * as ${1:alias} from &#x27;${2:path}&#x27;;&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Import all modules with an alias&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"اسم-نوع-بديل\">اسم نوع بديل</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Type Alias&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;typealias&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;type ${1:TypeName} = ${2:Type};&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Type alias declaration&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"promise\">Promise</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Promise&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;promise&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;new Promise&lt;${1:Type}&gt;((resolve, reject) =&gt; {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t${2}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;});&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Basic Promise structure&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"طلب-workspace-أساسي\">طلب <code>Workspace</code> أساسي</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Basic fetch Request&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ffetch&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;try {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\tconst response = await fetch(&#x27;${1:url}&#x27;, {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t\\tmethod: &#x27;${2|POST,PUT,PATCH,DELETE,GET|}&#x27;,&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t\\tbody: ${3:JSON.stringify(data)}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t});&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\tconst data = await response.json();&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\tconsole.log(data);&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;} catch (error) {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\tconsole.error(&#x27;Error fetching data:&#x27;, error);&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;}&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Basic fetch request with error handling&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"استيراد-التصدير-الافتراضي\">استيراد التصدير الافتراضي</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Import Default Export&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;importdef&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;import ${1:defaultExport} from &#x27;${2:modulePath}&#x27;;&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Import default export&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"مسار-express-أساسي\">مسار Express أساسي</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Basic Express Route&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;expressroute&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;app.${1|get,post,put,patch,delete|}(&#x27;${2:path}&#x27;, (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) =&gt; {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t${3}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\tres.send(&#x27;${4:Hello World!}&#x27;);&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;});&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Basic Express route handler&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"مكون-react-أساسي\">مكوّن React أساسي</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Basic React Component&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rc&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;import React from &#x27;react&#x27;;&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;interface ${1:Props} {}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;const ${2:ComponentName}: React.FC&lt;${1:Props}&gt; = ({}) =&gt; {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\treturn (&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t\\t&lt;div&gt;&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t\\t\\t${3}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t\\t&lt;/div&gt;&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t);&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;};&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;export default ${2:ComponentName};&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Basic functional React component&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"مقطع-ترويسة-الملف\">مقطع ترويسة الملف</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;File Header Snippet&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;fileheader&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/**&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot; * File: $TM_FILENAME&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot; * Date: $CURRENT_YEAR-$CURRENT_MONTH-$CURRENT_DATE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot; */&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Standard file header comment&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"التحويل-إلى-أحرف-كبيرة\">التحويل إلى أحرف كبيرة</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Transform to Uppercase&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;toupper&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;const originalWord = \\&quot;${1:word}\\&quot;;&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;const upperCaseWord = \\&quot;${1/(.*)/${1:/upcase}/}\\&quot;;&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Transform placeholder text to uppercase&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الإحاطة-بـ-trycatch\">الإحاطة بـ <code>try…catch</code></h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Surround with try/catch&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;prefix&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;trycatch&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;body&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;try {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\t$TM_SELECTED_TEXT&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;} catch (error) {&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;\\tconsole.error(error);&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Wrap selected code with try/catch&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n"}